  "wwLine1": "A companion doesn’t grow in a den. It grows beside you, step by step.",
  "wwLine2": "What you find along the way belongs to you both.",
  "wwLine3": "New tracks in the Market. But no companion gets far if it is only carried.",
  "wwLine4": "A seal only holds what the trail has put into it.",
  "wwLine5": "Two equal seals, one fire. Patience is the third.",
  "wwLine6": "At the right pace you hear each other breathe.",
  "wwLine7": "One more clip means more that comes home with you.",
  "wwLine8": "The first ember in the brass. It only burns because you walked.",
  "wwLine9": "Far lands send their creatures. They are looking for someone to walk with.",
  "wwLine10": "A full leash is a full trail.",
  "wwLine11": "Steam and cogs. Even machines only learn on the way.",
  "wwLine12": "Forged five times. Now your hands know it.",
  "wwLine13": "Two powers in one seal, like two who walk the same trail.",
  "wwLine14": "Two together don’t make the trail shorter, but brighter.",
  "wwLine15": "Even between the stars only the next step counts.",
  "wwLine16": "The crown is not given. It is walked.",
  "wwLine17": "More room in the den. The growing still happens outside.",
  "wwLine18": "Whoever keeps the beat, the ember follows.",
  "wwLine19": "No end, only a bend. The trail grows with you.",
